    # "{i}镜子里的人脸颊微红。{/i}"
    "{i}The person in the mirror has flushed cheeks.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3355
translate english bar_restroom_830d7f43:

    # "【微信】{i}妈：「你什么时候回家？」{/i}"
    "{i}WeChat — Mom: When are you coming home?{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3356
translate english bar_restroom_4e232a9e:

    # "【微信】{i}闺蜜：「那个项目怎么样了？」{/i}"
    "{i}WeChat — Best Friend: How’s that project going?{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3358
translate english bar_restroom_5e0476ce:

    # "{i}你深吸一口气，现在你暂时逃离了那个世界。{/i}"
    "{i}You take a deep breath. For now, you have escaped that world.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3359
translate english bar_restroom_4f2c9a9e:

    # "{i}但你知道，总得回去，过明天。{/i}"
    "{i}But you know you still have to go back. You still have to live through tomorrow.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3367
translate english bar_restroom_again_a53f4636:

    # "{i}洗手间有人，先出去吧。{/i}"
    "{i}Someone is in the restroom. Better go out first.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3375
translate english beer_adfd4c12:

    # "{i}一杯精酿啤酒，泡沫细腻。{/i}"
    "{i}A glass of craft beer, its foam soft and delicate.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3376
translate english beer_96e0e713:

    # "{i}人生得意须尽欢，此刻的泡沫托起你所有的轻盈。{/i}"
    "{i}When life offers a moment of joy, take it. For now, the foam holds up all your lightness.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3383
translate english wine_13d690e2:

    # "{i}红酒在杯中摇晃，颜色深沉。{/i}"
    "{i}Red wine sways in the glass, dark and deep.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3384
translate english wine_53d476ce:

    # "{i}葡萄美酒夜光杯，敬那个在深夜依然一往无前的自己。{/i}"
    "{i}A luminous cup of wine—to the self that still moves forward in the dark.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3391
translate english cocktail_458dfea0:

    # "{i}五颜六色的液体，不知道里面有什么。{/i}"
    "{i}A colorful liquid. You don’t know what’s inside.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3392
translate english cocktail_5b005bf5:

    # "{i}彩虹沉入杯底，等你打捞。每一口都是未知，每一步都是风景。{/i}"
    "{i}A rainbow sinks to the bottom of the glass, waiting for you to fish it out. Every sip is unknown. Every step is a view.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3399
translate english soda_7b25a5dc:

    # "{i}可乐加冰，气泡刺激着喉咙。{/i}"
    "{i}Cola with ice. The bubbles sting your throat.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3400
translate english soda_7556e63e:

    # "{i}众人皆醉我独醒。猛兽总是独行，牛羊才成群结队。{/i}"
    "{i}Everyone else is drunk, but you remain awake. Beasts walk alone; cattle and sheep move in herds.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3457
translate english bar_ending_95ef0ed1:

    # "{i}夜深了，大家陆续离开。{i}"
    "{i}It is late. People begin leaving one after another.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3458
translate english bar_ending_cd78e1e2:

    # "{i}凉风吹在脸上，路灯是朦胧的，微醺的感觉。{i}"
    "{i}A cool breeze brushes your face. The streetlights blur softly. You feel slightly tipsy.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3460
translate english bar_ending_491db807:

    # s "看看地铁时间……"
    s "Let me check the subway time..."

# game/script.rpy:3461
translate english bar_ending_35395bcf:

    # s "啊……末班车还有15分钟到，要过去地铁站时间有点紧啊……"
    s "Ah... the last train arrives in 15 minutes. It’ll be tight getting to the station in time..."

# game/script.rpy:3470
translate english bar_ending_fb9f6100:

    # chen "上车吧，我们顺路。"
    chen "Get in. We’re going the same way."

# game/script.rpy:3477
translate english bar_ending_49ea6fbd:

    # "{i}要上车吗？{/i}"
    "{i}Do you get in?{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3482
translate english bar_ending_7249db62:

    # "那谢谢陈总了。"
    "Thank you, Mr. Chan."

# game/script.rpy:3496
translate english get_in_car_fc18e8c5:

    # "{i}拉开车门，坐进副驾驶，你感觉到皮革座椅的冰凉，闻到车内淡淡的古龙水味。{/i}"
    "{i}You pull open the car door and sit in the passenger seat. The leather seat feels cold beneath you, and the car carries a faint scent of cologne.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3497
translate english get_in_car_1076395a:

    # chen "系好安全带。"
    chen "Fasten your seat belt."

# game/script.rpy:3507
translate english refuse_car_safe_eaf523d3:

    # s "不用了，我坐地铁，挺方便的。"
    s "No thanks. I’ll take the subway. It’s convenient enough."

# game/script.rpy:3514
translate english refuse_car_safe_6abbd089:

    # chen "末班车快没了，你确定？"
    chen "The last train is almost gone. Are you sure?"

# game/script.rpy:3516
translate english refuse_car_safe_8b0451df:

    # s "我赶得上，谢谢陈总。"
    s "I can make it. Thank you, Mr. Chan."

# game/script.rpy:3518
translate english refuse_car_safe_6536e4de:

    # "{i}你后退一步，点头致谢。{/i}"
    "{i}You take a step back and nod in thanks.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3522
translate english refuse_car_safe_f91c6e62:

    # "{i}黑夜里尾灯消失，光线渐暗，但你感到十分心安。{/i}"
    "{i}The taillights disappear into the night. The light fades, but you feel strangely at ease.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3534
translate english question_chen_2fb3eed6:

    # s "您怎么知道我住在哪？"
    s "How do you know where I live?"

# game/script.rpy:3547
translate english question_chen_2840b12a:

    # chen "HR档案里记着大家的联络地址，我记得自己手底下所有团队成员的信息。"
    chen "HR files keep everyone’s contact address. I remember the information of every team member under me."

# game/script.rpy:3555
translate english question_chen_998d9618:

    # chen "这是关心的方式，就像现在问你要不要搭便车一样。"
    chen "It’s a way of caring. Just like asking whether you need a ride right now."

# game/script.rpy:3561
translate english question_chen_18e584a4:

    # chen "怎么样，走吗？"
    chen "So? Are you coming?"

# game/script.rpy:3571
translate english question_chen_cd1d1150:

    # "{i}你意识到继续对峙没有意义。{/i}"
    "{i}You realize there is no point in continuing the confrontation.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3573
translate english question_chen_5cc5cf43:

    # s "……那麻烦您了。"
    s "...Then sorry for the trouble."

# game/script.rpy:3586
translate english question_chen_ee7467e1:

    # s "我还是坐地铁吧，谢谢您关心。"
    s "I’ll still take the subway. Thank you for your concern."

# game/script.rpy:3590
translate english question_chen_adbb79aa:

    # "{i}背后的沉默像浓重的夜色，但你走得坚定无比。{/i}"
    "{i}The silence behind you feels as heavy as the night, but your steps are firm.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3601
translate english safe_ending_a4e6fe56:

    # "{i}你冲进地铁站。{/i}"
    "{i}You rush into the subway station.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3608
translate english safe_ending_d8fc94b6:

    # s "末班车还有3分钟。赶上了！"
    s "Three minutes until the last train. I made it!"

# game/script.rpy:3613
translate english safe_ending_efc92a3d:

    # "{i}车厢里空荡荡的，你坐在角落，剧烈喘息。{/i}"
    "{i}The carriage is empty. You sit in the corner, breathing hard.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3621
translate english safe_ending_661d627a:

    # chen "注意安全。"
    chen "Stay safe."

# game/script.rpy:3622
translate english safe_ending_7c279645:

    # s "……"
    s "..."

# game/script.rpy:3632
translate english chapter_2_end_b4827e7c:

    # "{i}你终于回到家，锁上门。{i}"
    "{i}You finally get home and lock the door behind you.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3646
translate english chapter_2_end_7c279645:

    # s "……"
    s "..."

# game/script.rpy:3648
translate english chapter_2_end_7b01889b:

    # "{i}放下包，靠在门上，林姐的话在耳边回响：{/i}"
    "{i}You put down your bag and lean against the door. Ms Lam’s words echo in your ears:{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3649
translate english chapter_2_end_2617044c:

    # "{i}「别认为“他”让你觉得自己特别。」{/i}"
    "{i}“Don’t think he is the one who makes you special.”{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3650
translate english chapter_2_end_5c2af938:

    # "{i}这一周结束了，His Game成功了。{/i}"
    "{i}The week is over. His Game was a success.{/i}"

