translate english chapter_2_end_aed88873:

    # "{i}但某种游戏，才刚刚开始。{/i}"
    "{i}But another kind of game has only just begun.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:3657
translate english chapter_2_end_e787520f:

    # "{i}游戏的一方是陈永仁，但你隐隐感觉自己不是另一方唯一的执棋人。"
