    "{i}Three weeks later.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:5660
translate english police_result_6245547a:

    # "【短信通知】"
    "[Text Message Notification]"

# game/script.rpy:5661
translate english police_result_b570b815:

    # "「经调查，证据不足，不予立案。」"
    "After investigation, there is insufficient evidence. The case will not be accepted."

# game/script.rpy:5665
translate english police_result_877934ca:

    # "新物品：【报警回执单2号】"
    "New Item: Police Report Receipt No. 2"

# game/script.rpy:5666
translate english police_result_0c3995cd:

    # "又一张盖着公章的纸。又一段被程序终结的正义。"
    "Another stamped piece of paper. Another piece of justice ended by procedure."

# game/script.rpy:5678
translate english route_b_hr_d17c92d5:

    # "你选择了内部渠道。"
    "You chose the internal channel."

# game/script.rpy:5679
translate english route_b_hr_eb947c81:

    # "你相信公司会保护自己人。你相信规则之内能解决。"
    "You believe the company will protect its own. You believe things can be solved within the rules."

# game/script.rpy:5687
translate english task_5_b_1_2a478be8:

    # "HR总监办公室。3楼。"
    "HR Director’s Office. 3rd Floor."

# game/script.rpy:5691
translate english task_5_b_1_a5d73cc1:

    # 'HR总监' "佘小姐，请坐。这事很严重，你明白吗？"
    'HR Director' "Miss Sheh, please sit. This is a serious matter. You understand that, right?"

# game/script.rpy:5692
translate english task_5_b_1_83e6fb1f:

    # 'HR总监' "指控一位高级经理……我们需要非常谨慎。"
    'HR Director' "Accusing a senior manager... we have to be very cautious."

# game/script.rpy:5698
translate english task_5_b_1_f07f6294:

    # s "我不是指控，我是举报。这是两回事。"
    s "I’m not accusing him. I’m reporting him. Those are two different things."

# game/script.rpy:5699
translate english task_5_b_1_72be53f6:

    # 'HR总监' "……措辞的区别。继续。"
    'HR Director' "...A difference in wording. Continue."

# game/script.rpy:5702
translate english task_5_b_1_a2add22e:

    # s "我有证据。工资差异记录。聊天记录。证人。"
    s "I have evidence. Wage discrepancy records. Chat records. Witnesses."

# game/script.rpy:5703
translate english task_5_b_1_b8b22aab:

    # 'HR总监' "请出示。"
    'HR Director' "Please show them."

# game/script.rpy:5707
translate english task_5_b_1_322e4798:

    # s "我要这次谈话有记录。邮件抄送，或者会议纪要。"
    s "I want this conversation recorded. Email CC, meeting minutes, anything official."

# game/script.rpy:5708
translate english task_5_b_1_db0f4c85:

    # 'HR总监' "……当然。这是标准流程。"
    'HR Director' "...Of course. That is standard procedure."

# game/script.rpy:5711
translate english task_5_b_1_7be4b396:

    # "你把证据摊在桌上。"
    "You spread the evidence across the desk."

# game/script.rpy:5713
translate english task_5_b_1_4dea30d7:

    # 'HR总监' "明白了。我们会内部调查。有结果通知你。"
    'HR Director' "Understood. We will conduct an internal investigation and notify you of the result."

# game/script.rpy:5720
translate english task_5_b_1_2d1c8f96:

    # "{i}2周后。{/i}"
    "{i}Two weeks later.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:5727
translate english task_5_b_1_e9a2c5dc:

    # 'HR总监' "调查结束。无充分证据证明不当行为。"
    'HR Director' "The investigation is complete. There is insufficient evidence to prove misconduct."

# game/script.rpy:5728
translate english task_5_b_1_ebb56537:

    # 'HR总监' "但已提醒陈经理注意职业边界。"
    'HR Director' "However, Manager Chan has been reminded to maintain professional boundaries."

# game/script.rpy:5730
translate english task_5_b_1_e7ce740c:

    # s "……就这样？"
    s "...That’s it?"

# game/script.rpy:5732
translate english task_5_b_1_1eb010bc:

    # 'HR总监' "佘小姐，我建议你关注自己的职业发展。"
    'HR Director' "Miss Sheh, I suggest you focus on your own career development."

# game/script.rpy:5733
translate english task_5_b_1_a0609bcf:

    # 'HR总监' "对了，部门重组的通知你收到了吗？"
    'HR Director' "By the way, have you received the department restructuring notice?"

# game/script.rpy:5742
translate english task_5_b_1_1ad5d237:

    # "偏远办公室。独自一人。没团队。"
    "A remote office. Alone. No team."

# game/script.rpy:5743
translate english task_5_b_1_12e875c2:

    # "你的工位对着墙。没有窗。"
    "Your desk faces the wall. There is no window."

# game/script.rpy:5755
translate english route_c_public_236159b6:

    # "你选择了公众。"
    "You chose to go public."

# game/script.rpy:5756
translate english route_c_public_d04672f5:

    # "你相信声音。你相信众目睽睽之下，真相无法被掩埋。"
    "You believe in voice. You believe truth cannot be buried under everyone’s gaze."

# game/script.rpy:5903
translate english task_5_c_1_70ea8861:

    # "帖子发出。"
    "The post goes live."

# game/script.rpy:5909
translate english task_5_c_1_bbe57880:

    # "24小时。"
    "24 hours."

# game/script.rpy:5910
translate english task_5_c_1_e6cefe83:

    # "9万浏览量。"
    "90,000 views."

# game/script.rpy:5911
translate english task_5_c_1_95f4181e:

    # "7000多条评论。"
    "More than 7,000 comments."

# game/script.rpy:5912
translate english task_5_c_1_f87a7777:

    # "2家媒体联系。"
    "Two media outlets reach out."

# game/script.rpy:5914
translate english task_5_c_1_391b1f27:

    # "{i}反噬。{/i}"
    "{i}Backlash.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:5916
translate english task_5_c_1_2bf9a2b8:

    # "她就是想要钱。"
    "She just wants money."

# game/script.rpy:5917
translate english task_5_c_1_d51aa0ec:

    # "为什么不早说？"
    "Why didn’t she say something earlier?"

# game/script.rpy:5918
translate english task_5_c_1_2399619d:

    # "他是个好人，她在毁他。"
    "He’s a good man. She’s ruining him."

# game/script.rpy:5923
translate english task_5_c_1_0e7f872f:

    # "压力+[public_pressure]。睡眠-80%%。"
    "Pressure +[public_pressure]. Sleep -80%%."

# game/script.rpy:5925
translate english task_5_c_1_f62c8f6a:

    # "但……"
    "But..."

# game/script.rpy:5927
translate english task_5_c_1_6d298761:

    # "【私信】姐妹，我也经历过。谢谢你敢说。"
    "[DM] Girl, I went through this too. Thank you for daring to speak up."

# game/script.rpy:5928
translate english task_5_c_1_299c9fea:

    # "【私信】我在这家公司3年了，一直不敢说。"
    "[DM] I’ve been at this company for three years. I never dared to say anything."

# game/script.rpy:5929
translate english task_5_c_1_79467db7:

    # "【私信】你不是一个人。"
    "[DM] You are not alone."

# game/script.rpy:5931
translate english task_5_c_1_08f4db66:

    # "你不再是一个人。"
    "You are no longer alone."

# game/script.rpy:5949
translate english route_d_leave_8ebc679e:

    # "你选择了离开。"
    "You chose to leave."

# game/script.rpy:5950
translate english route_d_leave_ee78baaa:

    # "有时候，活下去比赢更重要。"
    "Sometimes, surviving matters more than winning."

# game/script.rpy:6038
translate english task_5_d_1_22efa757:

    # "你写了'个人原因'。最安全的答案。最沉默的答案。"
    "You wrote, “Personal reasons.” The safest answer. The quietest answer."

# game/script.rpy:6040
translate english task_5_d_1_05aaf2bb:

    # "你留了一栏空白。有时候，空白比文字更响亮。"
    "You leave the reason field blank. Sometimes, a blank space speaks louder than words."

# game/script.rpy:6042
translate english task_5_d_1_837a38b5:

    # "你写下了真相。每一个字都像是从骨头上刮下来的。"
    "You write down the truth. Every word feels like it is being scraped from your bones."

# game/script.rpy:6043
translate english task_5_d_1_a86a6670:

    # "即使什么也改变不了。"
    "Even if nothing changes."

# game/script.rpy:6053
translate english last_day_f8afb7f3:

    # "最后一天。"
    "Your last day."

# game/script.rpy:6057
translate english last_day_746db621:

    # xiaojin "……真的要走了？"
    xiaojin "...You’re really leaving?"

# game/script.rpy:6059
translate english last_day_a47c438a:

    # s "嗯。"
    s "Mm."

# game/script.rpy:6061
translate english last_day_bb71bc6b:

    # xiaojin "这地方配不上你。但也……别太拼了，好吗？"
    xiaojin "This place doesn’t deserve you. But also... don’t push yourself too hard, okay?"

# game/script.rpy:6067
translate english last_day_cb432a38:

    # "林姐走过来。她看着你，很久。"
    "Ms Lam walks over. She looks at you for a long time."

# game/script.rpy:6068
translate english last_day_3247dc3a:

    # "然后她抱了你。"
    "Then she hugs you."

# game/script.rpy:6069
translate english last_day_3e8acabb:

    # "{i}她第一次碰你。{/i}"
    "{i}It is the first time she has touched you.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:6071
translate english last_day_6e1b08cd:

    # linjie "我撑了3年。你4个月。"
    linjie "I lasted three years. You lasted four months."

# game/script.rpy:6072
translate english last_day_79b62aeb:

    # linjie "你比我强。"
    linjie "You’re stronger than me."

# game/script.rpy:6079
translate english last_day_e6c125ce:

    # "你走出去。"
    "You walk out."

# game/script.rpy:6080
translate english last_day_8a28634a:

    # "大楼从外面看一样。永远一样。"
    "From the outside, the building looks the same. Always the same."

# game/script.rpy:6081
translate english last_day_65f5e556:

    # "已经有人坐在你工位上了。"
    "Someone is already sitting at your desk."

# game/script.rpy:6095
translate english chapter5_ending_bba02b24:

    # "第五章结束。"
    "Chapter 5 ends."

# game/script.rpy:6098
translate english chapter5_ending_57a22ec3:

    # "你选择了法律。程序走完了，正义还在路上。"
    "You chose the law. The procedure has run its course. Justice is still on the road."

# game/script.rpy:6100
translate english chapter5_ending_671050dc:

    # "你选择了内部。系统保护了系统，你学会了墙的颜色。"
    "You chose the internal system. The system protected itself. You learned the color of walls."

# game/script.rpy:6102
translate english chapter5_ending_54ab7776:

    # "你选择了公众。声音很吵，但至少有人听见了。"
    "You chose the public. The noise was loud, but at least someone heard you."

# game/script.rpy:6104
translate english chapter5_ending_b27d765a:

    # "你选择了离开。活着走出去，本身就是一种胜利。"
    "You chose to leave. Walking out alive is a victory in itself."

# game/script.rpy:6106
translate english chapter5_ending_f1a4acb8:

    # "《She: 镜中倒影》第五章 - 完"
    "She: Reflection in the Mirror — Chapter 5, End"

# game/script.rpy:6111
translate english ending_gulang_5375969a:

    # "结局：孤狼"
    "Ending: Lone Wolf"

# game/script.rpy:6188
translate english route_c_she_scene_57777229:

    # "黄昏的公司路口，晚风微凉，夕阳把地面染成暖橘色，路边行道树随风轻晃。"
    "At dusk, outside the company entrance, the evening breeze is cool. The sunset stains the ground a warm orange, and the roadside trees sway gently in the wind."

# game/script.rpy:6190
translate english route_c_she_scene_2089cebb:

    # "小曼抱着装满个人物品的纸箱，站在路口，指尖微微收紧，望着公司方向轻轻叹了口气，转头看向身旁两人。"
    "Siu Man holds a cardboard box filled with her belongings and stands at the intersection. Her fingers tighten slightly. She looks toward the company, lets out a soft sigh, then turns to the two people beside her."

# game/script.rpy:6192
translate english route_c_she_scene_bfe1317f:

    # s "就到这里吧，麻烦你们还特意下来送我。"
    s "This is far enough. Thank you for coming all the way down to see me off."

# game/script.rpy:6194
translate english route_c_she_scene_64c60727:

    # linjie "傻孩子，跟我们还说这些。这段时间辛苦你了，别把所有事都憋在心里。"
    linjie "Silly girl, you don’t have to say that to us. You’ve been through a lot lately. Don’t keep everything bottled up inside."

# game/script.rpy:6196
translate english route_c_she_scene_a6500388:

    # xiaojin "曼姐，以后不管遇到什么事，都别自己扛着，我们都在。"
    xiaojin "Siu Man, no matter what happens from now on, don’t carry it alone. We’re here."

# game/script.rpy:6198
translate english route_c_she_scene_1cddb05a:

    # "林姐轻轻开口，哼起《送别》的旋律，小金随即轻声附和，小曼垂眸，也慢慢跟着哼唱。"
    "Ms Lam begins softly, humming the melody of Farewell. Siu Gam quietly joins in. Siu Man lowers her eyes and slowly hums along."

# game/script.rpy:6200
translate english route_c_she_scene_9f57fb0e:

    # "三人合唱（声音轻柔，满是离愁）：长亭外，古道边，芳草碧连天……"
    "The three sing together, their voices soft and full of parting sorrow: beyond the pavilion, beside the old road, green grass stretches to the sky..."

# game/script.rpy:6202
translate english route_c_she_scene_1d8cc9b1:

    # s "……我们同唱芳草天。"
    s "...Together, we sing beneath the endless green."

# game/script.rpy:6204
translate english route_c_she_scene_47ab31da:

    # "林姐与小金对视一眼，没有打断，依旧顺着旋律继续唱，晚风将歌声轻轻吹散。"
    "Ms Lam and Siu Gam exchange a glance. They do not interrupt her. They continue following the melody, and the evening wind gently carries their song away."

# game/script.rpy:6206
translate english route_c_she_scene_6190983b:

    # "三人合唱：晚风拂柳笛声残，夕阳山外山。"
    "The three sing together: the evening wind brushes the willows, the flute fades, and beyond the sunset, mountains rise behind mountains."

# game/script.rpy:6208
translate english route_c_she_scene_037be5c2:

    # s "我走啦，你们回去吧。"
    s "I’m leaving now. You should head back."

# game/script.rpy:6210
translate english route_c_she_scene_f7f50229:

    # linjie "照顾好自己，常联系。"
    linjie "Take care of yourself. Keep in touch."

# game/script.rpy:6212
translate english route_c_she_scene_72af4628:

    # xiaojin "对，有事随时说！"
    xiaojin "Yeah. If anything happens, tell us anytime!"

# game/script.rpy:6214
translate english route_c_she_scene_cce9ac1d:

    # "小曼转身，脚步平稳地向前走去，夕阳将她的影子拉长，林姐和小金站在原地，静静望着她的背影，直到渐渐远去。"
    "Siu Man turns around and walks forward with steady steps. The sunset stretches her shadow long across the ground. Ms Lam and Siu Gam remain where they are, quietly watching her figure until it slowly fades into the distance."

