    "Siu Man" "No."

# game/script.rpy:6618
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_9a437f3e:

    # '值班民警' "那目前只能先登记。是否立案，还需要进一步判断。"
    "Police Officer" "Then for now, we can only register the report first. Whether a case can be filed still requires further assessment."

# game/script.rpy:6623
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_99f50ec1:

    # "{i}3周后。{/i}"
    "{i}Three weeks later.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:6625
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_4a967e61:

    # "证据不足，不予立案。"
    "Insufficient evidence. Case not accepted."

# game/script.rpy:6627
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_c08a4735:

    # "CG：空文"
    "CG: Blank Document"

# game/script.rpy:6642
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_b11ed570:

    # "你找林姐请假，去派出所提交了找到的证据照片。"
    "You ask Ms Lam for leave and go to the police station to submit the evidence photos you found."

# game/script.rpy:6644
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_36d14eaa:

    # "民警在看你提供的材料。"
    "The officer looks through the materials you provided."

# game/script.rpy:6648
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_3cedd079:

    # '值班民警' "这些材料里出现的人不像你啊。"
    "Police Officer" "The people in these materials don’t look like you."

# game/script.rpy:6650
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_dc6f6536:

    # '小曼' "这些是他骚扰的其他同事。"
    "Siu Man" "These are other coworkers he harassed."

# game/script.rpy:6652
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_fd330618:

    # '值班民警' "佘小姐，我们的法律是“谁主张，谁举证”。"
    "Police Officer" "Miss Sheh, under our law, whoever makes a claim must provide evidence."

# game/script.rpy:6654
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_d954a439:

    # '值班民警' "你不可以代为举证。"
    "Police Officer" "You cannot provide evidence on someone else’s behalf."

# game/script.rpy:6656
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_ee19bf44:

    # '小曼' "…………"
    "Siu Man" "..."

# game/script.rpy:6658
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_98fa82a6:

    # '值班民警' "这是受理回执，有进展会通知你。"
    "Police Officer" "This is the receipt for your report. We will notify you if there is any progress."

# game/script.rpy:6660
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_95d51105:

    # '小曼' "我提交的聊天记录、职场录音、同事证词，你们都看了吗？"
    "Siu Man" "Did you look at the chat records, workplace recordings, and coworker testimonies I submitted?"

# game/script.rpy:6662
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_96d2c7c7:

    # '值班民警' "这些材料我们都收到了，我们会按流程处理调查，您可以回去了。"
    "Police Officer" "We have received all the materials. We will process and investigate according to procedure. You may go."

# game/script.rpy:6666
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_0f6a1bc4:

    # '值班民警' "材料我们收到了。"
    "Police Officer" "We have received the materials."

# game/script.rpy:6668
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_f88a6210:

    # '值班民警' "但车里的关键事实仍然缺少直接证据。"
    "Police Officer" "But the key facts of what happened in the car still lack direct evidence."

# game/script.rpy:6673
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_dbe3a13c:

    # "3周后。"
    "Three weeks later."

# game/script.rpy:6675
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_4a967e61:

    # "证据不足，不予立案。"
    "Insufficient evidence. Case not accepted."

# game/script.rpy:6677
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_c08a4735:

    # "CG：空文"
    "CG: Blank Document"

# game/script.rpy:6682
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_1b4f9621:

    # '小曼' "好受打击，但还是得干活，继续找线索。"
    "Siu Man" "It hurts, but I still have work to do. I have to keep looking for clues."

# game/script.rpy:6684
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_fe1483a8:

    # '小曼' "我一定要让陈永仁付出代价！"
    "Siu Man" "I will make Chan Wing Yan pay for this!"

# game/script.rpy:6686
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_e3d05663:

    # "你正要继续工作，却看到陈永仁把 Bella 单独叫进办公室。"
    "You are about to continue working when you see Chan Wing Yan call Bella into his office alone."

# game/script.rpy:6688
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_39faf922:

    # '小曼' "？我得去看看。"
    "Siu Man" "Huh? I need to go check."

# game/script.rpy:6693
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_9a9b04eb:

    # "你到办公室门口正要进去，发现林姐也在。"
    "You arrive at the office door and are about to go in, only to find that Ms Lam is there too."

# game/script.rpy:6695
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_211a9437:

    # "你正要进门，林姐拦住了你。"
    "Just as you are about to enter, Ms Lam stops you."

# game/script.rpy:6697
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_0bcd6406:

    # '小曼' "不是林姐，Bella 刚刚……"
    "Siu Man" "No, Ms Lam, Bella just..."

# game/script.rpy:6699
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_5adbcaa8:

    # '林姐' "你在这儿等着。"
    "Ms Lam" "Wait here."

# game/script.rpy:6701
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_a67b5b1d:

    # "林姐进去提起了有关其他深度项目的话题，把实习生 Bella 支走了。"
    "Ms Lam goes in and brings up another in-depth project topic, sending the intern Bella away."

# game/script.rpy:6703
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_faf079c8:

    # '小曼' "……小心点啊。"
    "Siu Man" "...Be careful."

# game/script.rpy:6705
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_860388b5:

    # 'Bella' "啊？……哦。"
    'Bella' "Huh?... Oh."

# game/script.rpy:6707
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_770376bc:

    # "看 Bella 的表情从迷茫到若有所思，你放心了，回到工位上。"
    "Seeing Bella’s expression shift from confusion to thoughtfulness, you feel relieved and return to your desk."

# game/script.rpy:6709
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_885b182e:

    # "【微信】林姐：你很勇敢。"
    "WeChat - Ms Lam: You are very brave."

# game/script.rpy:6710
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_db9aa8f3:

    # "【微信】林姐：那么我也该更进一步了。"
    "WeChat - Ms Lam: Then I should take one more step too."

# game/script.rpy:6712
translate english she_ending_a1_kongwen_easter_eb93ac4c:

    # '小曼' "墨镜黄豆表情。"
    "Siu Man" "Sunglasses emoji."

# game/script.rpy:6727
translate english she_ending_b1_yinshui_13eabf14:

    # "{i}文件：调岗通知，上面有陈永仁的签字。{/i}"
    "{i}File: Transfer Notice. Chan Wing Yan’s signature is on it.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:6729
translate english she_ending_b1_yinshui_d140ff27:

    # "你向公司举报陈永仁性骚扰。"
    "You report Chan Wing Yan to the company for sexual harassment."

# game/script.rpy:6731
translate english she_ending_b1_yinshui_0638cd9f:

    # "因为没有证据，公司并未接受你的举报。"
    "Because there is not enough evidence, the company does not accept your report."

# game/script.rpy:6733
translate english she_ending_b1_yinshui_dba2769d:

    # "举报的消息被陈永仁知道，你被调岗去了别的地方。"
    "Chan Wing Yan finds out about the report, and you are transferred somewhere else."

# game/script.rpy:6738
translate english she_ending_b1_yinshui_ccf93982:

    # '小曼' "新工位和设计部还在同一层，只是离得很远。"
    "Siu Man" "My new desk is still on the same floor as the Design Department. It is just very far away."

# game/script.rpy:6740
translate english she_ending_b1_yinshui_04200d89:

    # '小曼' "饮水机成了我唯一的同事，它不会说话，不过也不会对我动手动脚。"
    "Siu Man" "The water dispenser has become my only colleague. It doesn’t talk, but at least it doesn’t touch me."

# game/script.rpy:6742
translate english she_ending_b1_yinshui_f436e7a1:

    # '小曼' "办公区的最边缘，工作内容也是最边缘。"
    "Siu Man" "The edge of the office. The edge of the work."

# game/script.rpy:6744
translate english she_ending_b1_yinshui_5b1d9621:

    # '小曼' "好处的话……大概是喝水变得容易了吧。"
    "Siu Man" "If there’s one good thing... I guess drinking water has become easier."

# game/script.rpy:6746
translate english she_ending_b1_yinshui_e111883e:

    # "小曼喝水。"
    "Siu Man takes a sip of water."

# game/script.rpy:6748
translate english she_ending_b1_yinshui_5a5a31ab:

    # "她抬头看到对面另外一个茶水间先后进去了两个人。"
    "She looks up and sees two people enter another pantry across the room one after another."

# game/script.rpy:6750
translate english she_ending_b1_yinshui_8d809c11:

    # '小曼' "【联系人-Bella】我看到陈永仁和你一起在茶水间，注意点。"
    "Siu Man" "Contact - Bella: I saw Chan Wing Yan enter the pantry with you. Be careful."

# game/script.rpy:6752
translate english she_ending_b1_yinshui_639ff399:

    # '小曼' "水温刚好。"
    "Siu Man" "The water temperature is just right."

# game/script.rpy:6754
translate english she_ending_b1_yinshui_583c2137:

    # "CG：饮水"
    "CG: Drinking Water"

# game/script.rpy:6769
translate english she_ending_c1_tuichang_ce27354b:

    # "你把自己的经历和猜测发上网，希望大家关注职场性骚扰问题。"
    "You post your experience and suspicions online, hoping people will pay attention to workplace sexual harassment."

# game/script.rpy:6771
translate english she_ending_c1_tuichang_84fe3454:

    # "公司好像发现了这个帖子，你被人事约谈了。"
    "The company seems to have found the post, and HR asks to speak with you."

# game/script.rpy:6776
translate english she_ending_c1_tuichang_70236972:

    # '小曼' "冒昧问一下，公司是想来处理这件事，还是来处理我？"
    "Siu Man" "May I ask, is the company here to deal with this matter, or to deal with me?"

# game/script.rpy:6778
translate english she_ending_c1_tuichang_8b04c59a:

    # '小曼' "如果不是前者的话，不用说了。"
    "Siu Man" "If it’s not the former, there’s no need to continue."

# game/script.rpy:6780
translate english she_ending_c1_tuichang_cdeadbbf:

    # '小曼' "这样的地方没有待下去的必要。"
    "Siu Man" "There is no reason to stay in a place like this."

# game/script.rpy:6782
translate english she_ending_c1_tuichang_ee45b40f:

    # '小曼' "我辞职。"
    "Siu Man" "I resign."

# game/script.rpy:6787
translate english she_ending_c1_tuichang_f1727cb1:

    # "桌面收拾干净了，桌上只有一个背包和一个屏幕亮着的手机。"
    "The desk has been cleared. Only a backpack and a phone with its screen still lit remain on it."

# game/script.rpy:6789
translate english she_ending_c1_tuichang_c3b78cab:

    # "你的小紫书帖子评论总数停在423条，热度早就掉了。"
    "Your PurpleNote post stops at 423 comments. The heat has long faded."

# game/script.rpy:6791
translate english she_ending_c1_tuichang_ec59e730:

    # "最新一条评论是：又一个蹭热度的。"
    "The latest comment says: Another clout chaser."

# game/script.rpy:6793
translate english she_ending_c1_tuichang_d72afe4f:

    # "你关掉了手机。"
    "You turn off your phone."

# game/script.rpy:6795
translate english she_ending_c1_tuichang_75ab18b0:

    # "CG：退场"
    "CG: Exit"

# game/script.rpy:6810
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_a9c410ed:

    # '小曼' "林姐，不好意思又打扰你……我找律师了。"
    "Siu Man" "Ms Lam, sorry to bother you again... I found a lawyer."

# game/script.rpy:6812
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_78de3720:

    # '小曼' "但是律师说我当时没有上车，既没有实际遭遇侵害，也没有留下证据。"
    "Siu Man" "But the lawyer said that because I didn’t get in the car at the time, I neither experienced actual assault nor left direct evidence."

# game/script.rpy:6814
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_6fa41269:

    # '小曼' "其他收集的材料照片，我并不是当事人。几乎没有胜算。"
    "Siu Man" "As for the other photos and materials I collected, I am not the person directly involved. There is almost no chance of winning."

# game/script.rpy:6816
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_dd270b13:

    # '小曼' "可是我看到那些照片和档案，好多惊才绝艳的前辈本应该站在更高的位置，却因为陈永仁黯淡下去了。"
    "Siu Man" "But when I saw those photos and files, I realized so many brilliant senior women should have stood somewhere higher, yet they faded because of Chan Wing Yan."

# game/script.rpy:6818
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_685ceb1a:

    # '小曼' "我、我想问问你，愿意成为站出来起诉陈永仁的人吗。"
    "Siu Man" "I... I wanted to ask whether you would be willing to be the one to stand up and sue Chan Wing Yan."

# game/script.rpy:6820
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_52776ace:

    # '林姐' "佘小姐，是我曾经对你说的话释放了一些错误的信号吗？"
    "Ms Lam" "Miss Sheh, did something I once said give you the wrong signal?"

# game/script.rpy:6822
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_99c0d120:

    # '林姐' "你想做救世主，有野心。"
    "Ms Lam" "You want to be a savior. You have ambition."

# game/script.rpy:6824
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_f8482dde:

    # '林姐' "但是你想过吗，站在亲历者面前诉说你没有经历过这件事，需要亲历者重新再现那段记忆。"
    "Ms Lam" "But have you thought about this? You are standing in front of someone who actually lived through it, asking her to reopen that memory for something you did not truly experience yourself."

# game/script.rpy:6826
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_8a90d582:

    # '林姐' "你没有真正经历过，你根本……"
    "Ms Lam" "You didn’t really go through it. You simply..."

# game/script.rpy:6828
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_e09d2088:

    # '林姐' "……算了。"
    "Ms Lam" "...Forget it."

# game/script.rpy:6830
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_0588284c:

    # '林姐' "我还有工作事宜，失陪。"
    "Ms Lam" "I still have work to do. Excuse me."

# game/script.rpy:6832
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_9e2699ca:

    # '小曼' "对不起……是我冒犯。"
    "Siu Man" "I’m sorry... I crossed a line."

# game/script.rpy:6834
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_a075bf95:

    # '林姐' "我不后悔酒后说的那番话。"
    "Ms Lam" "I don’t regret what I said after drinking that night."

# game/script.rpy:6836
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_a7bf74ac:

    # '林姐' "但也希望你能理解，一个伤口愈合前，它的痂不管有多么厚，撕下来都是血淋淋的。"
    "Ms Lam" "But I also hope you can understand this: before a wound heals, no matter how thick the scab becomes, tearing it off will still draw blood."

# game/script.rpy:6838
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_dab4d3fa:

    # '小曼' "……我记住了。"
    "Siu Man" "...I’ll remember that."

# game/script.rpy:6840
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_334115b3:

    # "林姐走开。"
    "Ms Lam walks away."

# game/script.rpy:6842
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_205a9632:

    # '小曼' "嗯，林姐，对不起，还有谢谢你。"
    "Siu Man" "Ms Lam, I’m sorry. And thank you."

# game/script.rpy:6844
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_9ec3ebf5:

    # '小曼' "以及祝你工作顺利！"
    "Siu Man" "Also, I hope work goes well for you!"

# game/script.rpy:6846
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_10baaee0:

    # '小曼' "不是没营养的客套，就是希望你顺利，一切都好。"
    "Siu Man" "That’s not empty small talk. I just hope things go smoothly for you. I hope everything gets better."

# game/script.rpy:6848
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_87741e05:

    # "电梯门关上。"
    "The elevator doors close."

# game/script.rpy:6853
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_7552c02d:

    # '林姐' "我听到了。你也顺利。"
    "Ms Lam" "I heard you. I hope things go smoothly for you too."

# game/script.rpy:6855
translate english she_ending_d1_xiangxi_8e6bb55a:

    # "CG：相惜"
    "CG: Mutual Respect"

# game/script.rpy:6870
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_54d8979d:

    # '小曼' "我要举报陈永仁性骚扰，所有证据都在这里。"
    "Siu Man" "I want to report Chan Wing Yan for sexual harassment. All the evidence is here."

# game/script.rpy:6872
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_52d15902:

    # 'HR' "材料放这儿，你可以走了。"
    'HR' "Leave the materials here. You may go."

# game/script.rpy:6874
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_d3007998:

    # "她低头干着手头的工作。"
    "She keeps her head down, still working on her own tasks."

# game/script.rpy:6876
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_8a3c248f:

    # '小曼' "您不看看证据吗？"
    "Siu Man" "Aren’t you going to look at the evidence?"

# game/script.rpy:6878
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_9cb0d858:

    # 'HR' "……新来的？"
    'HR' "...New here?"

# game/script.rpy:6880
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_740db50d:

    # "她瞥了你一眼，拿起你提交的材料浏览起来。"
    "She glances at you, then picks up the materials you submitted and begins browsing through them."

# game/script.rpy:6882
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_6da00bb3:

    # 'HR' "现在的情况，我建议你不要做无用功。"
    'HR' "Given the current situation, I suggest you don’t waste your effort."

# game/script.rpy:6884
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_07fcece0:

    # '小曼' "这些证据不够多吗？但是他伤害的人够多了。"
    "Siu Man" "Isn’t this enough evidence? Even if it isn’t, he has hurt enough people."

# game/script.rpy:6886
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_967def32:

    # 'HR' "……"
    'HR' "..."

# game/script.rpy:6888
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_67a9ce07:

    # 'HR' "行，我可以帮你提交，回去等通知吧。"
    'HR' "Fine. I can submit this for you. Go back and wait for notice."

# game/script.rpy:6893
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_13eabf14:

    # "{i}文件：调岗通知，上面有陈永仁的签字。{/i}"
    "{i}File: Transfer Notice. Chan Wing Yan’s signature is on it.{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:6895
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_28911f08:

    # "你正要离开现在的工位。"
    "You are about to leave your current desk."

# game/script.rpy:6897
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_eae1132a:

    # '陈永仁' "哎，刚好，Bella 你坐这里吧。"
    "Chan Wing Yan" "Ah, perfect timing. Bella, you can sit here."

# game/script.rpy:6899
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_d07db19d:

    # "Bella 惊喜地看了你一眼，趁陈永仁不注意，悄悄用眼神和你打了个招呼。"
    "Bella looks at you in surprise. While Chan Wing Yan isn’t paying attention, she quietly greets you with her eyes."

# game/script.rpy:6901
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_a7bc9adf:

    # '陈永仁' "有能力的新人真多啊，要好好深耕啊。"
    "Chan Wing Yan" "So many capable newcomers these days. You have to cultivate them properly."

# game/script.rpy:6906
translate english she_ending_b2_xuyu_25c6528f:

    # '陈永仁' "从新人走到这个位置十几年，想要晋升怎么做、遇到委屈怎么忍，我可太清楚了。"
    "Chan Wing Yan" "It took me more than ten years to get from a newcomer to this position. How to get promoted, how to swallow grievances—I know all of it too well."

# game/script.rpy:6908
