    "Several media outlets contact you through private messages."

# game/script.rpy:7351
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_e0ff765c:

    # "网上情况持续发酵，大家建立 #SheIsMe 词条说出职场性骚扰或性别歧视问题。"
    "The situation continues to spread online. People create the hashtag #SheIsMe to speak out about workplace sexual harassment and gender discrimination."

# game/script.rpy:7353
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_765fc5dc:

    # "公司信息和陈永仁的劣迹被扒出。"
    "The company’s information and Chan Wing Yan’s past misconduct are dug up."

# game/script.rpy:7355
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_70d78722:

    # "【评论：小曼，我也是曾经被他性骚扰的一员。如果你需要帮助，请联系我，我愿意和你站在一起。】"
    "Comment: Siu Man, I was also one of the people he sexually harassed. If you need help, please contact me. I am willing to stand with you."

# game/script.rpy:7356
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_7cdf822a:

    # "【评论：我是那个笔记本里被语焉不详提到的李。希望我的亲身经历能给各位在职的姐妹提个醒。】"
    "Comment: I am the Li who was vaguely mentioned in that notebook. I hope my own experience can serve as a warning to all sisters still working there."

# game/script.rpy:7357
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_8905aea3:

    # "【评论：我是新来的实习生，也遇到了陈永仁。但我很幸运，部门里有两位前辈都在保护我。】"
    "Comment: I am the new intern, and I also encountered Chan Wing Yan. But I am lucky. Two senior women in the department have been protecting me."

# game/script.rpy:7362
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_e1e832b6:

    # "陈永仁上班时被媒体记者抓到采访，引起一些骚乱。"
    "When Chan Wing Yan arrives at work, media reporters catch him for an interview, causing a small commotion."

# game/script.rpy:7364
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_f589e8ab:

    # '记者1' "您好，您是陈永仁先生吗？昨天网络上有关于您性骚扰女员工的事件，您是否承认？"
    "Reporter 1" "Hello, are you Mr. Chan Wing Yan? Yesterday, there were online allegations that you sexually harassed female employees. Do you admit to them?"

# game/script.rpy:7366
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_f89e1c93:

    # '记者2' "据社媒上目前现身的受害者发言，您多次性骚扰员工。公司内部是否有包庇行为？"
    "Reporter 2" "According to victims who have come forward on social media, you repeatedly sexually harassed employees. Was there any cover-up inside the company?"

# game/script.rpy:7368
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_227e2922:

    # '陈永仁' "你们是？"
    "Chan Wing Yan" "Who are you?"

# game/script.rpy:7370
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_9e426517:

    # "上班时间快到了，人群逐渐聚集驻足围观。"
    "Work hours are about to begin, and people gradually gather and stop to watch."

# game/script.rpy:7372
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_11afa287:

    # "公司内部今天谈论的话题都是陈永仁被记者围堵。"
    "Inside the company, everyone is talking about Chan Wing Yan being surrounded by reporters."

# game/script.rpy:7374
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_b6a6e1ab:

    # '职员1' "最近不是在升职考核吗？这下他过不了了吧。"
    "Employee 1" "Isn’t he under promotion review recently? He probably won’t pass now."

# game/script.rpy:7376
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_dbd299ba:

    # '职员2' "这要还能顺利晋升，公司得被喷死。"
    "Employee 2" "If he still gets promoted smoothly after this, the company will be torn apart online."

# game/script.rpy:7378
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_4287c78b:

    # '职员3' "公司还是先关注舆情吧。"
    "Employee 3" "The company should focus on public opinion first."

# game/script.rpy:7380
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_2b2bf1bf:

    # "公司的举动被网民盯着，对陈永仁做了延迟升职的处理。"
    "With netizens watching the company’s every move, the company delays Chan Wing Yan’s promotion."

# game/script.rpy:7382
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_4dfb2488:

    # "同时为了降低大众关注度，让他近期居家办公。"
    "At the same time, to reduce public attention, they arrange for him to work from home for the time being."

# game/script.rpy:7387
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_69847eea:

    # '小曼' "{i}那天面试的时候，站在这里感觉自己被重重地压着。现在……{/i}"
    "Siu Man" "{i}During the interview that day, standing here felt like being pressed down by a heavy weight. Now...{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:7389
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_d5c437d8:

    # "现在这间办公室不再是陈永仁的了。"
    "Now this office no longer belongs to Chan Wing Yan."

# game/script.rpy:7391
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_6937791c:

    # "香水、档案和其他旧迹都被清除。"
    "The perfume, files, and all other traces of the past have been cleared away."

# game/script.rpy:7393
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_8aab322f:

    # "这间房间迎来了新生。"
    "This room has been given a new life."

# game/script.rpy:7395
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_ec2a7841:

    # "还有新的主人。"
    "And a new owner."

# game/script.rpy:7397
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_318ba7bb:

    # '???' "办公室就你一个？你们林总呢？"
    '???' "Only you in the office? Where is your Director Lam?"

# game/script.rpy:7399
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_fe5f43c3:

    # '小曼' "林总出去了，文件由我来转交就好。"
    "Siu Man" "Director Lam stepped out. I can pass the documents to her."

# game/script.rpy:7401
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_0d402173:

    # '小曼' "诶？您……"
    "Siu Man" "Huh? You..."

# game/script.rpy:7403
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_c9db66b6:

    # '???' "怎么，不是前几天还见过，不认识了？"
    '???' "What, we just met a few days ago. Don’t recognize me anymore?"

# game/script.rpy:7405
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_78bd9bbb:

    # '小曼' "是太认识了，您的耳饰很少见，但我总感觉在公司之外看到过……"
    "Siu Man" "I do recognize you. Your earrings are very distinctive, but I keep feeling like I’ve seen them somewhere outside the company..."

# game/script.rpy:7407
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_67c73dd4:

    # '小曼' "！"
    "Siu Man" "!"

# game/script.rpy:7409
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_2edc8c54:

    # '???' "想起来了？我还给你投了60块的推流呢。没想到帖子本身就很有关注度了。"
    '???' "Remember now? I even spent 60 yuan boosting your post. I didn’t expect the post itself to get so much attention."

# game/script.rpy:7411
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_66fdfab8:

    # '???' "很高兴认识你，小曼。"
    '???' "Nice to meet you, Siu Man."

# game/script.rpy:7413
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_504ef749:

    # "她向你伸出手。"
    "She reaches out her hand to you."

# game/script.rpy:7415
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_e062f905:

    # '小曼' "我也是。"
    "Siu Man" "Nice to meet you too."

# game/script.rpy:7417
translate english she_ending_c3_qingyun_26227360:

    # "CG：青云 / 飞鸟"
    "CG: Clear Sky / Flying Bird"

# game/script.rpy:7432
translate english she_ending_songbie_ac17a610:

    # "暴露后，不知何时传出了你做的拆解方案抄袭的消息，你被公司解雇了。"
    "After the exposure, rumors somehow spread that your analysis plan was plagiarized. You are fired by the company."

# game/script.rpy:7434
translate english she_ending_songbie_98bab96e:

    # "解雇那天，你在楼下，发现陈永仁在落地窗看你。"
    "On the day you are fired, you stand downstairs and notice Chan Wing Yan watching you through the floor-to-ceiling window."

# game/script.rpy:7436
translate english she_ending_songbie_bcc28ac5:

    # "他没看见公司大门口的遮雨檐挡住了你身边的人。"
    "He does not see that the rain canopy at the company entrance is blocking the people beside you."

# game/script.rpy:7440
translate english she_ending_songbie_9b379b2e:

    # '林姐' "我尽量跟人事那边说，不让你履历上落黑点。之后要推荐信就联系我。"
    "Ms Lam" "I’ll try to speak with HR and make sure this doesn’t leave a stain on your record. If you need a recommendation letter later, contact me."

# game/script.rpy:7442
translate english she_ending_songbie_2fb365b1:

    # '小曼' "好……林姐，谢谢你。"
    "Siu Man" "Okay... Ms Lam, thank you."

# game/script.rpy:7446
translate english she_ending_songbie_8eb6fdea:

    # '小金' "小曼……我都知道了，我会努力给留下的女同事们帮忙的。"
    "Siu Gam" "Siu Man... I know everything now. I’ll do my best to help the female coworkers who stay behind."

# game/script.rpy:7448
translate english she_ending_songbie_406ff54f:

    # '小金' "陈永仁真不是人！"
    "Siu Gam" "Chan Wing Yan is not even human!"

# game/script.rpy:7450
translate english she_ending_songbie_a1d96f16:

    # '小曼' "不是人！"
    "Siu Man" "Not human!"

# game/script.rpy:7454
translate english she_ending_songbie_9b379b2e_1:

    # '林姐' "我尽量跟人事那边说，不让你履历上落黑点。之后要推荐信就联系我。"
    "Ms Lam" "I’ll try to speak with HR and make sure this doesn’t leave a stain on your record. If you need a recommendation letter later, contact me."

# game/script.rpy:7456
translate english she_ending_songbie_8eb6fdea_1:

    # '小金' "小曼……我都知道了，我会努力给留下的女同事们帮忙的。"
    "Siu Gam" "Siu Man... I know everything now. I’ll do my best to help the female coworkers who stay behind."

# game/script.rpy:7458
translate english she_ending_songbie_19764e7b:

    # '小曼' "好……谢谢你们。"
    "Siu Man" "Okay... thank you both."

# game/script.rpy:7460
translate english she_ending_songbie_5e46792d:

    # '小金' "陈永仁真不是人。"
    "Siu Gam" "Chan Wing Yan is not even human."

# game/script.rpy:7462
translate english she_ending_songbie_b5b43623:

    # '林姐' "嗯。"
    "Ms Lam" "Mm."

# game/script.rpy:7464
translate english she_ending_songbie_d5f0951f:

    # '小金' "事已至此，唱首歌送送你——长亭外，古道边……"
    "Siu Gam" "Since things have come to this, let me sing you off — beyond the pavilion, beside the old road..."

# game/script.rpy:7466
translate english she_ending_songbie_e736a970:

    # '小曼' "芳草天……"
    "Siu Man" "Green grass under the sky..."

# game/script.rpy:7468
translate english she_ending_songbie_887d8e1b:

    # '林姐' "不是芳草碧连天吗，怎么……"
    "Ms Lam" "Isn’t it green grass stretching to the sky? Why..."

# game/script.rpy:7470
translate english she_ending_songbie_d7032724:

    # '林姐' "哦。"
    "Ms Lam" "Oh."

# game/script.rpy:7472
translate english she_ending_songbie_8d89d2d6:

    # "CG：送别"
    "CG: Farewell"

# game/script.rpy:7487
translate english she_ending_tuoniao_8b904990:

    # "你把手机扣在床头。"
    "You place your phone face down by the bed."

# game/script.rpy:7489
translate english she_ending_tuoniao_99e9ce93:

    # "通知还在震动。"
    "The notifications are still vibrating."

# game/script.rpy:7491
translate english she_ending_tuoniao_8516fcfc:

    # "世界像一只手，把你往被子里按。"
    "The world feels like a hand pressing you down into the blanket."

# game/script.rpy:7493
translate english she_ending_tuoniao_6bdabacd:

    # '小曼' "睡一觉吧。"
    "Siu Man" "Just sleep for a while."

# game/script.rpy:7495
translate english she_ending_tuoniao_237760ca:

    # '小曼' "一切，都会好的。"
    "Siu Man" "Everything will be okay."

# game/script.rpy:7497
translate english she_ending_tuoniao_eb10b517:

    # "CG：鸵鸟"
    "CG: Ostrich"

# game/script.rpy:7512
translate english she_ending_gulang_ac17a610:

    # "暴露后，不知何时传出了你做的拆解方案抄袭的消息，你被公司解雇了。"
    "After the exposure, rumors somehow spread that your analysis plan was plagiarized. You are fired by the company."

# game/script.rpy:7514
translate english she_ending_gulang_ddedad36:

    # "你一个人抱着纸箱站在公司门口。"
    "You stand alone at the company entrance, holding a cardboard box."

# game/script.rpy:7516
translate english she_ending_gulang_6ba30cac:

    # "陈永仁站在落地窗后，看着你。"
    "Chan Wing Yan stands behind the floor-to-ceiling window, watching you."

# game/script.rpy:7518
translate english she_ending_gulang_cbe0d2bd:

    # "没有人从楼里走出来。"
    "No one walks out of the building."

# game/script.rpy:7520
translate english she_ending_gulang_63f9b697:

    # "没有人叫住你。"
    "No one calls out to you."

# game/script.rpy:7522
translate english she_ending_gulang_049490bb:

    # "没有同伴的日子里，一只狼要小心啊。"
    "On days without companions, a lone wolf must be careful."

# game/script.rpy:7524
translate english she_ending_gulang_7d5195f2:

    # "CG：孤狼"
    "CG: Lone Wolf"

# game/script.rpy:7539
translate english she_ending_manyou_f85a3156:

    # "你把知道的信息全部填了上去，一键发布。"
    "You fill in everything you know and publish it with one click."

# game/script.rpy:7541
translate english she_ending_manyou_c3eac93d:

    # "【评论：这到底在说什么。】"
    "Comment: What is this even talking about?"

# game/script.rpy:7542
translate english she_ending_manyou_67f07805:

    # "【评论：没看懂。】"
    "Comment: I don’t get it."

# game/script.rpy:7543
translate english she_ending_manyou_2fa56be9:

    # "【评论：是被骚扰还是工资太少？】"
    "Comment: Was she harassed, or was her salary just too low?"

# game/script.rpy:7544
translate english she_ending_manyou_ab769f0a:

    # "【评论：疑似工资太少编炸裂事件博眼球，散了散了。】"
    "Comment: Seems like she made up some explosive story because her salary was too low. Just trying to get attention. Move along."

# game/script.rpy:7546
translate english she_ending_manyou_99b55a44:

    # "你看着屏幕，手指僵在半空。"
    "You stare at the screen, your finger frozen in midair."

# game/script.rpy:7548
translate english she_ending_manyou_c9f49a77:

    # "你说了很多。"
    "You said so much."

# game/script.rpy:7550
translate english she_ending_manyou_e92df336:

    # "但最重要的那件事，反而被淹没了。"
    "But the most important thing was drowned out instead."

# game/script.rpy:7552
translate english she_ending_manyou_3fb15e80:

    # "CG文案：一案一诉，保持专注。"
    "CG Text: One case, one claim. Stay focused."

# game/script.rpy:7554
translate english she_ending_manyou_01674f15:

    # "CG：漫游"
    "CG: Drifting"

# game/script.rpy:7568
translate english she_ending_common_569549a0:

    # "{i}SHE{/i}"
    "{i}SHE{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:7569
translate english she_ending_common_4d047715:

    # "{i}THE END{/i}"
    "{i}THE END{/i}"
